            <rule id="8bc9-9b93-061e-6b83" name="Army General (+25 pts; if no Khalifa)" hidden="false">
              <description>Amir as Army General: if no Khalifa is chosen, an Amir may be upgraded to Army General (+25 pts). Not available to Arab Conquest armies (their only general is a Companion upgraded to Army General).</description>
