            <profile id="f31e-6708-573e-020f" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mixed weapons (counts as a hand weapon &amp; javelins) and shield. May have throwing spear instead of javelins (+1 pt). Any unit may be Riding Camels (+1 pt). Combined Formation - up to half the models may exchange mixed weapons for bow (free). Levies count as Levies. Not available to Arab Conquest... (Levies may not be chosen in Arab Conquest armies). (Byzantium p.83)</characteristic>
