            </profile>
            <profile id="c571-7515-0442-f0d6" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, buckler &amp; sling or javelins. May exchange sling or javelins for short bow (+1 pt), bow (+2 pts), and exchange buckler for shield (free). May be Riding Camels (+1 pt). Levies are Skirmishers and count as Levies. Light Troop models with bows may not outnumber Light Troop models armed with other weapons. (Byzantium p.83)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="8d24-0e38-281c-ddcc" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
