              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, sling or javelins and a shield. May exchange sling or javelins for bow (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Stealth. 0-1 units (Umayyad armies: two units). Resilient and swift warriors from the mountain tribes of the caliphate. (Byzantium p.84)</characteristic>
